# The log of the test must have a line for each of these patterns (grep -E). A line with "!" at the start is a
# pattern that the log must not have.
# The exit dialog is open over the main menu.
\[6\.00\].* MenuUIMessageBoxWindow 
# The click on the New Game button of the menu below the dialog opens no screen.
\[8\.00\].* MenuUIMessageBoxWindow 
!MenuSelectDifficulty
# After the answer No, the dialog is gone, and the Exit button of the main menu has the focus again.
!\[9\.50\].* MenuUIMessageBoxWindow 
\[9\.50\].* MenuUIMenuButtonWindow x=7 y=359 w=245 h=27 selectable focus
# The Escape key then closes the main menu.
\[11\.00\].* DeusExRootWindow 
!\[11\.00\].* MenuMain 
